{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_05_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_05","title":"物资回收计划","storyCode":"OD-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"6b45afd28b348c8ffef4e8b3eae10b35b42c5aa367c55a79b79f1a8f2401eab6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"安全屋的物资与粮食短缺，罗德岛干员提议去被摧毁的感染者社区回收尚未被带走的粮食补给，但是在行动中他们遭遇了长泉镇的领主卫队。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"有发现吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了！虽然量不多，但是有收获。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，这些粮食加上安全屋的应急储备，应该能够省省勉强再过一个星期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"时候不早了，先回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......有人来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......十几个人，可能是雇佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不要和他们缠斗。快！往安全屋方向！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"他们还跟着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不太对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道这群人肯定不会善罢甘休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里战斗容易被包围，继续撤退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"追兵。准备战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要开枪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们不是那些雇佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......是瑞柏巴军人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"是本地卫兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不要动手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卫兵，包围这个建筑！不要让任何人跑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我们是不是被包围了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......情况不太妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"领主卫队为什么要包围我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们先别说话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲在里面的人，听好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是长泉镇卫兵队长，长泉镇领主之女皮加尔·图拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在所有人都给我放下武器，乖乖地滚出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要尝试挑战我的耐心，你们会后悔的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"魁梧的瑞柏巴战士用长戟柄端用力击打地面。\n一瞬间，大地都在震动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇佣兵，又是雇佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这群无德无耻无信无义的恶徒！我那个恶贯满盈的兄弟到底给了你们多少金子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们逃不掉的，我要碾碎你们，我要击溃你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要让你们为恶行付出代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等你们死在我刀下后，你们才会知道，再多脏钱也买不来第二条性命！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"喔！喔！你确定他们是来“帮忙”的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这是要把我们挂在城门口吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我最担心的情况。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"这中间肯定是有什么误会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"皮加尔大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫是罗德岛外勤干员，代号巡林者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛与您的家族应当签署过相关的协议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛！道貌岸然的伪君子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的父亲信任你们，他相信你们的承诺，才同意这个安全屋的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你们是怎么报答我的父亲的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们绑架镇民！掠夺他们的财富！我都看到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些背信弃义的恶徒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"但凡你有点脑子，就不该说出这么蠢的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们的目的是掠夺这个镇子，那我们还在这里逗留这么长时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花言巧语！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们又是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们拿着铳器站在我父亲的领地上，还敢在这里狡辩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你这么厉害，之前干什么去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你和领主卫队放任暴徒袭击病人社区，拼死救人的是我们，不是你那不出动的宝贝卫队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你还跑来满嘴胡话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静。这人不太像是能讲得通道理的那类人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皮加尔大人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是感染者社区的米亚罗医生！你以前见过我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你，我认得你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛没有劫掠感染者，我可以作证！我们是被那些暴徒赶到这里来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不止是我，这里的其他感染者也可以作证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皮加尔大人，请您相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我相信你，医生，很多人都讲述过你的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您，皮加尔大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我不信任他们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"魁梧的领主之女用巨大的长戟指向前方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们未经许可手持兵械进入我父亲的领地，这就是大忌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在你们保护了我父亲的领民的份上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不追究你们私携武装的责任！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于罗德岛！你们与我父亲签署的合同，即日内作废。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"......请您三思。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事没什么值得商量的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长泉镇不需要其他武装人员，就算是罗德岛也一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会带走所有的感染者，将他们安置在合适的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其余的你们不需过问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，别说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不要忤逆本地领主，这里是萨尔贡，别忘了我们现在代表罗德岛的立场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"四十一、四十二......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有其他人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这些了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没事，接下来你们就安全了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科恩小姐，亚历山大先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间，非常感谢你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说，该说谢谢的是我们这边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们打算去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"还没确定呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"不要搞得这么悲伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们以后说不定还会再见面呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"下次我还得给你讲一讲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......狗头人的故事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，这个是给你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......源石锭，这我不能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"是报酬，你替奥克芬治好了腿，这是罗德岛给你的酬金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是简单的急救处理......不值这么多钱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为是值得的，收下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您，巡林者先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后......谢谢各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"这事情不对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，本来以为谨慎一些总没错，没想到反而产生了误会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁能想到这卫兵队长是个这么不讲道理的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_npc_155_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这蠢女人，脑袋里面也是肌肉吧，我还以为这类人在黑钢已经够多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_npc_156_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"安全屋里的东西......基本都被他们收缴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"至少大家毫发无伤，这已经是不幸中的万幸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"奥克芬先生和我们一起出发吧，你可以先在办事处那边登记，我们向本舰联络之后，再一起商量后续行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"也只能这样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......我有点不放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"你指什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......这个叫皮加尔的人......有没有可能她才是这一切的始作俑者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"领主迟迟没有出现，雇佣兵一直想要绑架这些感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在来了一个卫兵队长，名正言顺地带走了所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"这是不是太巧了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说的还真有点道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......我打算尾随......去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我也去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"不，太多人容易引起警觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人随时待命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你会反对这个计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"审时度势，不和本地领主发生冲突，不代表我们什么都不做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡林者","speakerId":"char_503_rang","isRemote":false,"text":"有些时候，一些小诡计是必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先把所有人都带到避难所去，然后带三个人和我一起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怀疑矿坑里有问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"避难所里还有位置吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是很够了，半个镇子的人现在都躲在避难所里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实在不行就让他们住在楼上，把我父亲的房间给他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这......这合适吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么不好，如果父亲还活着他也会这么做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，保持警惕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，我们出来的时候把灯都熄灭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不记得......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闪开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"源石畸变体","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敌袭！保护镇民！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这都是从哪儿冒出来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要耗在这里，准备突围！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领主卫兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们人太多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们带着平民先走！我断后！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来啊，你们这些无胆匪类！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......这是第几只了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"皮加尔大人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生！你怎么在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别过去！领主宅邸已经被......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德鲁奇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你给我滚出来！我要把你的头砍下来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......你的嗓门还是这么大，我亲爱的妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"皮加尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_159_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你这个恶棍......我饶不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德鲁奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让我看看你有什么本事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"当魁梧的瑞柏巴用令人惊叹的速度冲向自己的兄长时，她才意识到——\n——自己中计了。\n在夜色的掩护中，在破败不堪的房屋后，有一台轰隆作响的机器。\n一瞬间，她感到自己被什么东西猛烈地撞击了，头晕目眩，仿佛是被投石机投出的巨石正中面门。\n下一刻，她失去了意识。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["灰烬"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["闪击"]},{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["霜华"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["战车"]},{"speakerId":"char_503_rang","aliases":["巡林者"]}]}
